        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the past, many families kept dogs to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "guard",
            "ref": "v-guard"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " homes or cats to catch mice. But now, pets often sleep on soft beds, wear cute clothes, and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "celebrate",
            "ref": "v-celebrate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " birthdays. Some owners even take them to pet hotels or buy special cakes for them. This new trend is called “raising pets like children”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Why is this happening? Experts say many young people live "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "alone",
            "ref": "v-alone"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or feel stressed from work and study. Pets can give "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "comfort",
            "zh": "安慰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", friendship, and happy moments. Some people say their pets feel like family members."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The pet "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "industry",
            "zh": "行业"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is also growing quickly. More stores now sell pet toys, healthy food, and beauty "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "services",
            "ref": "v-service"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". One pet owner said, “My dog is like my little sister. I want her to stay healthy and happy every day.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "However, experts remind people that pets are living animals, not toys. Owners should care for them "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "responsibly",
            "zh": "负责地"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and never "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "abandon",
            "zh": "抛弃"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them."
          }
        ]
      },
